\section{Register data}{

Entity, role, group, signature and update data retrieved at runtime
come from the Brønnøysund Register Centre's open APIs and are
licensed under NLOD 2.0; the licence requires attribution to the
Brønnøysund Register Centre when the data are redistributed. KLASS
labels retrieved at runtime are Statistics Norway's.
